  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut pumpkin into thin wedges. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b73de2c06261b8d1677b3c-358a9725.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Place carrot and zucchini mix on a second lined oven tray. Season with salt and pepper, drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast pumpkin and veggies until tender, 25-30 minutes. Allow to cool slightly.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b73de2c06261b8d1677b3c-3022a7aa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine ciabatta chunks, savoury seasoning and a good drizzle of olive oil.\n• In the last 7 minutes of cook time, place ciabatta on the tray with the veggies. Bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, in a small bowl, combine fetta cubes and Greek-style yoghurt and mash to combine. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b73de2c06261b8d1677b3c-55b8adcc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies and croutons have cooled slightly, add mixed salad leaves and balsamic vinaigrette to the carrot and zucchini tray. Season and toss to coat.\n• Divide roast veggie salad between bowls then top with roast pumpkin.\n• Spoon over fetta yoghurt. Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b73de2c06261b8d1677b3c-31efe9a3.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
